	<description>	

		We are TEAM UGLY, an Independent developer team established in Barcelona, ​​focused on the research and crafting of rare videogames.

	</description>

		

	<histories>
		<history>

			<header>Team Ugly</header>

			<text>
				Imagine an old workshop lost in the narrow streets of an old town, if you know the boss  you will be able to access to the backroom and look into these unique video games dragees carefuly preserved for you.
			</text>

		</history>


		
		<history>

			<header>Rita Fortuny</header>

			<text>
				Producer. Since 2017, Rita was managing interactive projects for serious and big companies, till 2021 when she realized her inside ugliness, she left business consulting to marry the ugly side of videogames.
			</text>

		</history>

		<history>

			<header>Gerard Singuerlin</header>

			<text>
				Game designer and artist. 10 years of experience as an animator and illustrator that pushes this creative side of TEAM UGLY.
			</text>

		</history>


		<history>

			<header>Franc Porta</header>

			<text>
				Programmer. A technical but also extremely creative mind that was corrupted by the Great Uglyness. With a single word (code), he gives life to the game and its environments.
			</text>

		</history>
	
		<history>

			<header>Jaime Vicente</header>

		<text>
			Technical artist. He was infected by UGLY from the beginning. His long career as an artist and his eccentric gaits help us to coordinate and consolidate art and programming.
		</text>

		</history>
		
	</histories>

		

